<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαυγ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glance, shine through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ σχισμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					3.3.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕως οὗ ἡμέρα διαυγάσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Pet.</u>
					1.19
				</span></i>
			: impers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα τῷ
			διαυγάζειν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν
			ἡμέραν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.104.5
			</span></i>; <i>to be transparent,</i> Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				15.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτίζω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: and so metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαυγασθείς</span>”
				<i>being enlightened, perceiving the truth,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					5.10.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>influence by its rays</i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθεωρέω</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				1.130.70
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be glazed,</i> of pottery, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1143.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
